# Build context of docker/back and docker/front (the repo root): only what
# their COPY lines use, without local build output and dependencies, so local
# images are built like CI's (npm ci, not the host's front/node_modules).
*
!back/
!front/
!docker/
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
